    <string name="help">Every PDF directly inside the input folder becomes a subfolder in the output folder, with one image per page (page_0001, page_0002, …).\n\nIt keeps running in the background with the screen off. If you stop it or it gets interrupted, press Start again with the same folders and it picks up where it left off.\n\nThe PDFs need to be stored on the phone (for example in Downloads), not only in Google Drive.</string>
